{#- One lazily-loaded slice of an embedded collection.

    Rendered by AbstractCrudController::collectionEntries() and injected into
    the existing .form-collection-items list by the loader in layout.html.twig.
    Only the entries themselves - no wrapper, no <form> - so the markup drops
    straight in beside the ones the initial page already rendered.

    form_row per entry (not form_widget) so each keeps the same accordion
    shell, label wrapper and per-entry action buttons as a normally rendered
    one; a lazily fetched entry must be indistinguishable from an eager one. -#}
{% for entry in entries %}
    {{- form_row(entry) -}}
{% endfor %}
